<title>NETHERLANDS: ING'S MENDES GANS 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>ING'S MENDES GANS 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	   514.00 vs 491.00</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.4  vs  10.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		102.00 vs  98.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax operating profit	  16.8  vs  15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank Mendes Gans NV is 55 percent owned by financial</p>
<p>services group Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV (ING).</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
